      "Status": "Registered",
      "SummaryOfActivities": "Maintained and presented a venue of historical and cultural significance for public enjoyment.  Provided recreational and educational experiences to more than 100,000 visitors.  Hosted a community Christmas Carols event, open by donation, attended by over 500 members of the local community.  Offered two-for-one entry for Companion Card holders to support accessibility and inclusion.  Waived six weeks of venue hire fees for the Perth Hills Armadale Visitor Centre to host a tourism pop-up stand at *It s Yates Springtime at Araluen*, representing an in-kind contribution valued at over $10,000.",
